text: ["({2/R} can be paid with any two mana or with {R}. This card's mana value is 6.)\\nFlame Javelin deals 4 damage to any target.", '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'Affinity for Islands (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each Island you control.)\\nFlying', 'Affinity for Mountains (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each Mountain you control.)\\nHaste', 'Cone of Flame deals 1 damage to any target, 2 damage to another target, and 3 damage to a third target.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {X}. Scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', 'Counter target spell.', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\n{3}: Turn Wall of Deceit face down.\\nMorph {U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)", "Demonfire deals X damage to any target. If a creature dealt damage this way would die this turn, exile it instead.\\nHellbent — If you have no cards in hand, this spell can't be countered and the damage can't be prevented.", 'Firebolt deals 2 damage to any target.\\nFlashback {4}{R} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Flying', "Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Waterspout Djinn unless you return an untapped Island you control to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\\nSuspend 4—{1}{U} (Rather than cast this card from your hand, you may pay {1}{U} and exile it with four time counters on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter. When the last is removed, you may cast it without paying its mana cost. It has haste.)', "Flying\\nWhen Mulldrifter enters the battlefield, draw two cards.\\nEvoke {2}{U} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", "Flying\\nWhen Riftwing Cloudskate enters the battlefield, return target permanent to its owner's hand.\\nSuspend 3—{1}{U} (Rather than cast this card from your hand, you may pay {1}{U} and exile it with three time counters on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter. When the last is removed, you may cast it without paying its mana cost. It has haste.)", 'Flying\\n{R}: Furnace Whelp gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{T}: Fledgling Mawcor deals 1 damage to any target.\\nMorph {U}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', "Flying\\n{U}: If target spell has only one target and that target is Quicksilver Dragon, change that spell's target to another creature.\\nMorph {4}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)", "Guile can't be blocked except by three or more creatures.\\nIf a spell or ability you control would counter a spell, instead exile that spell and you may play that card without paying its mana cost.\\nWhen Guile is put into a graveyard from anywhere, shuffle it into its owner's library.", "Haste\\nIf a spell you control would deal damage to an opponent, prevent that damage. Create a 3/1 red Elemental Shaman creature token with haste for each 1 damage prevented this way.\\nWhen Hostility is put into a graveyard from anywhere, shuffle it into its owner's library.", 'Haste\\nWhenever Slith Firewalker deals combat damage to a player, put a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Haste\\n{R}: Pyre Charger gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Incinerate deals 3 damage to any target. A creature dealt damage this way can't be regenerated this turn.", 'Keldon Megaliths enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R}.\\nHellbent — {1}{R}, {T}: Keldon Megaliths deals 1 damage to any target. Activate only if you have no cards in hand.', 'Magma Jet deals 2 damage to any target. Scry 2.', 'Morph {1}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Willbender is turned face up, change the target of target spell or ability with a single target.', 'Morph {2}{U}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Voidmage Apprentice is turned face up, counter target spell.', 'Morph {5}{U}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Brine Elemental is turned face up, each opponent skips their next untap step.', "Morph—Return two Islands you control to their owner's hand. (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Fathom Seer is turned face up, draw two cards.", "Return target creature to its owner's hand.\\nDraw a card.", 'Reveal the top five cards of your library. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', 'Sacrifice Bottle Gnomes: You gain 3 life.', 'Sacrifice Seal of Fire: It deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Suspend 4—{U} (Rather than cast this card from your hand, pay {U} and exile it with four time counters on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter. When the last is removed, you may cast it without paying its mana cost.)\\nTarget player draws three cards.', 'This spell costs {1} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nFireball deals X damage divided evenly, rounded down, among any number of targets.', "When Aethersnipe enters the battlefield, return target nonland permanent to its owner's hand.\\nEvoke {1}{U}{U} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", 'When Flametongue Kavu enters the battlefield, it deals 4 damage to target creature.', "When Ingot Chewer enters the battlefield, destroy target artifact.\\nEvoke {R} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", "When Inner-Flame Acolyte enters the battlefield, target creature gets +2/+0 and gains haste until end of turn.\\nEvoke {R} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", "When Man-o'-War enters the battlefield, return target creature to its owner's hand.", "Whenever Ophidian attacks and isn't blocked, you may draw a card. If you do, Ophidian assigns no combat damage this turn.", "You may return an Island you control to its owner's hand rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nCounter target spell unless its controller pays {1}.", "You may return two Islands you control to their owner's hand rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nDraw two cards.", "You may sacrifice two Mountains rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nFireblast deals 4 damage to any target.", "[+1]: Chandra Nalaar deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.\\n[−X]: Chandra Nalaar deals X damage to target creature.\\n[−8]: Chandra Nalaar deals 10 damage to target player or planeswalker and each creature that player or that planeswalker's controller controls.", '[+2]: Each player draws a card.\\n[−1]: Target player draws a card.\\n[−10]: Target player mills twenty cards.', '{2}, Reveal X blue cards from your hand, Sacrifice Martyr of Frost: Counter target spell unless its controller pays {X}.', '{2}: Target creature gains trample until end of turn. If this is the third time this ability has resolved this turn, you may add {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}.', '{7}{R}: Flamewave Invoker deals 5 damage to target player or planeswalker.', '{R}: Chartooth Cougar gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nMountaincycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Mountain card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', '{R}: Flamekin Brawler gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{R}{R}: Rakdos Pit Dragon gains flying until end of turn.\\n{R}: Rakdos Pit Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nHellbent — Rakdos Pit Dragon has double strike as long as you have no cards in hand.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Mind Stone: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: You may put a basic land card from your hand onto the battlefield tapped.', '{T}: Fireslinger deals 1 damage to any target and 1 damage to you.']
flavor: ['"Beauty to the eye does not always translate to the touch."\\n—Naimah, Femeref philosopher', '"Do not call the Balduvians barbaric. Their magic is as potent as it is primal."\\n—Zur the Enchanter', '"Fly us higher, out of its storm."\\n—Sisay, captain of the *Weatherlight*', '"For dim-witted, thick-skulled genetic mutants, they have pretty good aim."\\n—Sisay, captain of the *Weatherlight*', '"Remember the moral of the fireslinger fable: with power comes isolation."\\n—Karn, silver golem', '"Try to pretend like you understand what\'s important."', '"What is mana but possibility, an idea not yet given form?"\\n—Jhoira, master artificer', '"Who said there are no assurances in life? I assure you this is going to hurt."', '"You aren\'t invited."', 'After the fourth time Chandra left a place engulfed in flames, she decided to just go ahead and make it her thing.', "Baby dragons can't figure out humans—if they didn't want to be killed, why were they made of meat and treasure?", "Don't trust your secrets to the sea.", 'Elementals are ideas given form. This one is the idea of "smashitude."', "Embermages aren't well known for their diplomatic skills.", "Gyara Spearhurler would have been renowned for her deadly accuracy, if it weren't for her deadly accuracy.", 'His blade was forged over coals of moaning treefolk, curved at the optimum angle for severing heads, and heated to volcanic temperatures by his touch.', 'Inside even the humblest goblin lurks the potential for far greater things—and far worse.', "Pray that it doesn't seek the safety of your lungs.", 'Reach out and torch someone.', 'Reinforcements . . . or refreshments?', 'The longer it patrols the smoldering crags of the Oxidda Chain, the more it adopts their fiery temper.', 'The longer it soars above the shimmering swirls of the Quicksilver Sea, the more it adopts their unpredictability.', 'The pyromancer summoned up her mightiest onslaught of fire and rage. Jace feigned interest.', "The slith incubate in the Great Furnace's heat, emerging on Mirrodin's surface only when the four suns have aligned overhead.", 'The spell fell upon the crowd like a dragon, ancient and full of death.', 'Water calls to water, and the world is left exhausted and withered in its wake.', 'When he hits people, they stay hit.', "When provoked, a flamekin's inner fire burns far hotter than any giant's forge."]
artist: ['Aaron Boyd', 'Adam Rex', 'Alan Pollack', 'Ben Thompson', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Chippy', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Cliff Nielsen', 'Daren Bader', 'Dave Dorman', 'Donato Giancola', 'Eric Fortune', 'Eric Peterson', 'Greg Staples', 'Jason Chan', 'Jeff Reitz', 'Jim Nelson', 'John Avon', 'Jon J Muth', 'Justin Sweet', 'Kev Walker', 'Luca Zontini', 'Mark Poole', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Zug', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matthew D. Wilson', 'Michael Danza', 'Omar Rayyan', 'Pete Venters', 'Philip Straub', 'Ralph Horsley', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ron Spears', 'Ron Spencer', 'Scott Bailey', 'Stephen Tappin', 'Steve Prescott', 'Thomas Gianni', 'Tony Szczudlo', 'Trevor Hairsine', 'Wayne England', 'Yoshino Himori', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai']
