rulings: ["[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Putting a land onto the battlefield this way does not count as your one land play for the turn.'}, {'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'Putting the card onto the battlefield is optional. When the ability resolves, you can choose not to.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The trigger occurs when you use the Morph ability to turn the card face up, or when an effect turns it face up. It will not trigger on being revealed or on leaving the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'If a spell with split second is on the stack, you can still respond by turning this creature face up and targeting that spell with the trigger. This is because split second only stops players from casting spells or activating abilities, while turning a creature face up is a special action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability targets multiple things, you can\'t target it with Willbender\'s triggered ability, even if all but one of those targets have become illegal."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability targets the same player or object multiple times, you can\'t target it with Willbender\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You don\'t choose the new target for the spell until Willbender\'s triggered ability resolves. You must change the target if possible. However, you can\'t change the target to an illegal target. If there are no legal targets to choose from, the target isn\'t changed. It doesn\'t matter if the original target of that spell has somehow become illegal itself."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The trigger occurs when you use the Morph ability to turn the card face up, or when an effect turns it face up. It will not trigger on being revealed or on leaving the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a spell with split second is on the stack, you can still respond by turning this creature face up and targeting that spell with the trigger. This is because split second only stops players from casting spells or activating abilities, while turning a creature face up is a special action.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You choose a land to return and return it during resolution of the upkeep triggered ability. This means if you have two Waterspout Djinns, they must each return different Islands.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'If Rakdos Pit Dragon loses double strike after first strike combat damage has been dealt, it won’t deal damage during the normal combat damage step.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-07-15', 'text': 'A card that’s already revealed for another cost or because of an effect can be revealed to pay this cost.'}, {'date': '2006-07-15', 'text': 'Each card that’s revealed to pay the cost remains revealed until the ability leaves the stack.'}, {'date': '2006-07-15', 'text': 'If one of the cards that’s revealed to pay the cost leaves its owner’s hand before the ability resolves, it stops being revealed, but the value of X is not affected.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter how many cards you have in your hand when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-07-15', 'text': 'Regeneration abilities that would affect that creature can still be activated; they just won’t do anything. The creature can’t be regenerated for any reason, even if an effect other than Incinerate would deal lethal damage to it or otherwise destroy it.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'A spell exiled this way was never actually countered.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'Although this ability triggers when the Incarnation is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, it doesn’t *specifically* trigger on leaving the battlefield, so it doesn’t behave like other leaves-the-battlefield abilities. The ability will trigger from the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'Exiling the spell is mandatory. Casting it is not.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'Guile’s second ability replaces “counter [a certain spell]” with “exile [a certain spell] and you may cast it without paying its mana cost.” You have the option to cast it immediately upon its exile. If you choose not to, it remains exiled and you don’t get another chance to cast it. If the spell or ability that tried to counter the spell has additional effects, it then continues to resolve.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'If a spell or ability you control attempts to counter a spell that can’t be countered, it doesn’t. Since the spell wouldn’t be countered, Guile’s ability has no effect on it. The spell will continue to resolve normally.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'If the Incarnation had lost this ability while on the battlefield (due to Lignify, for example) and then was destroyed, the ability would still trigger and it would get shuffled into its owner’s library. However, if the Incarnation lost this ability when it was put into the graveyard (due to Yixlid Jailer, for example), the ability wouldn’t trigger and the Incarnation would remain in the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'If the Incarnation is removed from the graveyard after the ability triggers but before it resolves, it will remain in its new zone when its owner shuffles their library. Similarly, if a replacement effect has the Incarnation move to a different zone instead of being put into the graveyard, the ability won’t trigger at all.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'The last ability triggers when the Incarnation is put into its owner’s graveyard from any zone, not just from on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'Although this ability triggers when the Incarnation is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, it doesn’t *specifically* trigger on leaving the battlefield, so it doesn’t behave like other leaves-the-battlefield abilities. The ability will trigger from the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'If the Incarnation had lost this ability while on the battlefield (due to Lignify, for example) and then was destroyed, the ability would still trigger and it would get shuffled into its owner’s library. However, if the Incarnation lost this ability when it was put into the graveyard (due to Yixlid Jailer, for example), the ability wouldn’t trigger and the Incarnation would remain in the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'If the Incarnation is removed from the graveyard after the ability triggers but before it resolves, it will remain in its new zone when its owner shuffles their library. Similarly, if a replacement effect has the Incarnation move to a different zone instead of being put into the graveyard, the ability won’t trigger at all.'}, {'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'The last ability triggers when the Incarnation is put into its owner’s graveyard from any zone, not just from on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'To activate the second ability, you choose a value of X equal to or less than the number of loyalty counters on Chandra Nalaar. You may choose 0. You can’t choose a negative number.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A card with a monocolored hybrid mana symbol in its mana cost is each of the colors that appears in its mana cost, regardless of what mana was spent to cast it. Thus, Flame Javelin is red even if you spend six green mana to cast it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A card with monocolored hybrid mana symbols in its mana cost has a converted mana cost equal to the highest possible cost it could be cast for. Its converted mana cost never changes. Thus, Flame Javelin has a converted mana cost of 6, even if you spend {R}{R}{R} to cast it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a cost includes more than one monocolored hybrid mana symbol, you can choose a different way to pay for each symbol. For example, you can pay for Flame Javelin by spending {R}{R}{R}, {2}{R}{R}, {4}{R}, or {6}.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If an effect reduces the cost to cast a spell by an amount of generic mana, it applies to a monocolored hybrid spell only if you’ve chosen a method of paying for it that includes generic mana.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Mountaincycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on Mountaincycling this card. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops Mountaincycling from being activated.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Mountaincycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with Mountaincycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Unlike the normal cycling ability, Mountaincycling doesn\'t allow you to draw a card. Instead, it lets you search your library for a Mountain card. After you find a Mountain card in your library, you reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'You can choose to find any card with the Mountain land type, including nonbasic lands. You can also choose not to find a card, even if there is a Mountain card in your library.\'}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If there are fewer than twenty cards in the targeted player’s library, that player puts all the cards from their library into their graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when something “attacks and isn’t blocked” triggers in the declare blockers step after blockers are declared if (1) that creature is attacking and (2) no creatures are declared to block it. It will trigger even if that creature was put onto the battlefield attacking rather than having been declared as an attacker in the declare attackers step.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you cast this card for its evoke cost, you may put the sacrifice trigger and the regular enters-the-battlefield trigger on the stack in either order. The one put on the stack last will resolve first.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Aethersnipe can be the target of its own ability. If it’s the only nonland permanent on the battlefield, it must be the target of its ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you cast this card for its evoke cost, you may put the sacrifice trigger and the regular enters-the-battlefield trigger on the stack in either order. The one put on the stack last will resolve first.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Although originally printed with a characteristic-defining ability that defined its color, this card now has a color indicator. This color indicator can’t be affected by text-changing effects (such as the one created by Crystal Spray), although color-changing effects can still overwrite it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A card with no mana cost can’t be cast normally; you’ll need a way to cast it for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost, such as by suspending it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If a card with no mana cost is given an alternative cost equal to its mana cost (by Snapcaster Mage, for example), that cost cannot be paid and the card cannot be cast this way.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Each of the three targets must be different. If there aren’t three different legal targets available, you can’t cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If one or two of Cone of Flame’s targets are illegal when it resolves, you can’t change how much damage will be dealt to the remaining legal targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If another effect causes Daze to cost more, you must pay that additional cost even if you pay its alternative cost.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Fireball\'s damage is divided as Fireball resolves, not as it\'s cast, because there are no choices involved. The division involves only targets that are still legal as Fireball resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'For example, if X is 5 and you choose three target creatures, Fireball has a total cost of {7}{R} (even though its mana cost is just {5}{R} and its mana value is 6). If those creatures are all still legal targets as Fireball resolves, it deals 1 damage to each of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'You can target more than X creatures. However, if the number of legal targets at the time Fireball resolves is greater than X, none of them will be dealt any damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'You may cast Fireball with zero targets, regardless of the value chosen for X. If you do so, it will not be a targeted spell, and no damage will actually be dealt when it resolves.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You must be able to target another spell to cast Condescend. Condescend can’t target itself.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You scry 2 even if the spell’s controller pays {X}.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Soulbright Flamekin\'s ability uses the stack and can be responded to. Because it has a target, it\'s not a mana ability, even if you know that it will produce mana."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "When Soulbright Flamekin\'s ability resolves, it counts the number of times that same ability from that same creature has already resolved that turn. A copy of this ability (created by Rings of Brighthearth, for example) will count toward the total. Abilities from other creatures with the same name don\'t count towards the total. Neither does an ability that didn\'t resolve because its target was illegal."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You add eight red mana only the third time Soulbright Flamekin\'s ability resolves in a turn. You won\'t get the bonus the fourth, fifth, sixth, or any subsequent times in that same turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If there are no other creatures on the battlefield when Man-o\'-War enters the battlefield, its ability must target itself."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If an effect says that something doesn\'t untap during its controller\'s next untap step, that effect applies to the next untap step that isn\'t skipped."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Skipping your "next" untap step is cumulative. If a player turns two Brine Elementals face up on the same turn, that player\\\'s opponents will each skip their next two untap steps.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you pay the evoke cost, you can have Mulldrifter\'s own triggered ability resolve before the evoke triggered ability. You can cast spells after that ability resolves but before you have to sacrifice Mulldrifter."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an evoke cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined by only its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast that spell was."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A creature cast using suspend will enter the battlefield with haste. It will have haste until another player gains control of it. (In some rare cases, another player may gain control of the creature spell itself. If this happens, the creature won’t enter the battlefield with haste.)'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Flametongue Kavu’s ability can target itself. If it’s the only creature on the battlefield as its ability triggers, its ability must target itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Piles may be empty.'}]"]
foreign_names: ["[{'name': 'オキシダのゴーレム', 'text': '親和（山） （この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールする山１つにつき{1}少なくなる。）速攻', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': 'オキシダ連峰の煙吹く岩山の間を回る時間が長くなるほど、激しい気性が身に染みついてくる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227488&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb547fd8-d994-4f3e-a74a-150763e75366', 'multiverseId': 227488}, 'multiverseid': 227488}]", "[{'name': 'ケルドの巨石', 'text': 'ケルドの巨石はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}を加える。\\n暴勇 ― {1}{R}, {T}：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。ケルドの巨石はそれに１点のダメージを与える。 この能力はあなたの手札にカードがない場合にのみ起動できる。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227477&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58306c66-ee3d-4259-aa34-6a42c79746d5', 'multiverseId': 227477}, 'multiverseid': 227477}]", "[{'name': 'ジェイス・ベレレン', 'text': '+2：各プレイヤーはそれぞれカードを１枚引く。\\n-1：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを１枚引く。\\n-10：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、自分のライブラリーの一番上から20枚のカードを自分の墓地に置く。', 'type': 'プレインズウォーカー — ジェイス', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227476&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38f5e6d2-e4b2-4292-85d6-b14a26c8e909', 'multiverseId': 227476}, 'multiverseid': 227476}]", "[{'name': 'チャンドラ・ナラー', 'text': '+1：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。チャンドラ・ナラーはそのプレイヤーに１点のダメージを与える。\\n-X：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。チャンドラ・ナラーはそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\\n-8：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。チャンドラ・ナラーはそのプレイヤーとそのプレイヤーがコントロールする各クリーチャーにそれぞれ10点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'プレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227445&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27bed57a-027e-46c2-b87a-c52d18a357f9', 'multiverseId': 227445}, 'multiverseid': 227445}]", "[{'name': 'ボトルのノーム', 'text': 'ボトルのノームを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ノーム', 'flavor': '補強……それとも保養？', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227443&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c218e3b-90e4-412a-9b3e-09e926262566', 'multiverseId': 227443}, 'multiverseid': 227443}]", "[{'name': 'マグマの噴流', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。マグマの噴流はそれに２点のダメージを与える。\\n占術２を行う。 （占術２を行うには、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを見て、そのうちの望む枚数のカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置き、残りを望む順番で一番上に置く。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227478&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c535fb8d-fc2c-4e22-a034-f8b6733bf007', 'multiverseId': 227478}, 'multiverseid': 227478}]", "[{'name': 'ラクドスの地獄ドラゴン', 'text': '{R}{R}：ラクドスの地獄ドラゴンはターン終了時まで飛行を得る。\\n{R}：ラクドスの地獄ドラゴンはターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n暴勇 ― ラクドスの地獄ドラゴンは、あなたの手札にカードが無いかぎり二段攻撃を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227491&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd44828c6-5605-4494-9892-b1bbaf23e20b', 'multiverseId': 227491}, 'multiverseid': 227491}]", "[{'name': '内炎の見習い', 'text': '内炎の見習いが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋２/＋０の修整を受けるとともに速攻を得る。\\n想起 {R} （あなたはこの呪文を、その想起コストを支払って唱えてもよい。そうした場合、戦場に出たときにそれを生け贄に捧げる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・シャーマン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227471&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ed9ec7c-cb10-44b2-b6ba-d375672ea68d', 'multiverseId': 227471}, 'multiverseid': 227471}]", "[{'name': '卑下', 'text': '呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{X}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。\\n占術２を行う。 （占術２を行うには、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを見て、そのうちの望む枚数のカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置き、残りを望む順番で一番上に置く。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227447&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97a9aa6f-c8e7-4e1e-ba1d-e40ba8436bd0', 'multiverseId': 227447}, 'multiverseid': 227447}]", "[{'name': '嘘か真か', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーの一番上から５枚のカードを公開する。 いずれかの対戦相手は、それらのカードを２つの束に分ける。 一方の束をあなたの手札に加え、もう一方をあなたの墓地に置く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「何が重要かわかっているふりでもするがいい。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227454&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18b1a770-0a0e-4289-9216-95095b148cb9', 'multiverseId': 227454}, 'multiverseid': 227454}]", "[{'name': '噴出', 'text': 'あなたは噴出のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、あなたがコントロールする島を２つオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。\\nカードを２枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '秘密を海に託してはならない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227467&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '77774625-dab5-4e0e-857b-67c654094241', 'multiverseId': 227467}, 'multiverseid': 227467}]", "[{'name': '地形形成装置', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n{T}：あなたは、あなたの手札にある基本土地カードを１枚、タップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227498&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10fe9c76-97e2-49ce-a774-a21215051d21', 'multiverseId': 227498}, 'multiverseid': 227498}]", "[{'name': '塩水の精霊', 'text': '変異 {5}{U}{U} （あなたはこれを、{3}を支払うことで、裏向きの２/２のクリーチャーとして唱えてもよい。 いつでも変異コストを支払ってそれを表向きにすることができる。）\\n塩水の精霊が表向きになったとき、各対戦相手はそのプレイヤーの次のアンタップ・ステップを飛ばす。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': '水は水を呼び、その後に残された世界は疲れ果て干からびていく。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227444&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45be3ee2-c23d-4cde-a452-3e724648654d', 'multiverseId': 227444}, 'multiverseid': 227444}]", "[{'name': '大クラゲ', 'text': '大クラゲが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — クラゲ', 'flavor': '「見た目が美しくても、触って楽しいとはかぎらない。」\\n――フェメレフの哲人、ナイマ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227479&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df67caed-1d74-4089-866a-f8bab20f810b', 'multiverseId': 227479}, 'multiverseid': 227479}]", "[{'name': '大気の精霊', 'text': '飛行', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': 'そいつがお前の肺に逃げ込まないよう祈るんだな。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227441&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e7f6434-2b29-43a2-83c9-d6a1b16b9655', 'multiverseId': 227441}, 'multiverseid': 227441}]", "[{'name': '対抗呪文', 'text': '呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '紅蓮術師は最強の火と憤怒で猛攻を仕掛けた。 ジェイスは興味深そうなふりをした。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227449&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3fd33f73-6f6e-4591-86d5-3099acc7e9cb', 'multiverseId': 227449}, 'multiverseid': 227449}]", "[{'name': '尖塔のゴーレム', 'text': '親和（島） （この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールする島１つにつき{1}少なくなる。）飛行', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': '水銀海のきらめく渦の間に浸かる時間が長くなるほど、気まぐれさが身に染みついてくる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227497&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64ad8684-d7a9-4d73-a8f2-be863ac0b4ab', 'multiverseId': 227497}, 'multiverseid': 227497}]", "[{'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227482&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50ac403f-aa85-4866-a8d7-64ca87aa9b52', 'multiverseId': 227482}, 'multiverseid': 227482}]", "[{'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227483&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '837c9631-7496-480e-add1-4fd09d8503ea', 'multiverseId': 227483}, 'multiverseid': 227483}]", "[{'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227484&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef1b472a-0339-4d28-9514-6b49ed5a6cff', 'multiverseId': 227484}, 'multiverseid': 227484}]", "[{'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227485&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c543bf7a-33e8-430a-8ad2-4645ebc938f8', 'multiverseId': 227485}, 'multiverseid': 227485}]", "[{'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227472&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '623d9479-9dcc-4bc6-a3b8-59af5f550aed', 'multiverseId': 227472}, 'multiverseid': 227472}]", "[{'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227473&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ffdedd39-e9b1-4020-be51-dec21041e91f', 'multiverseId': 227473}, 'multiverseid': 227473}]", "[{'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227474&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9bfa9f9-da99-47e6-9465-3deb6b132ced', 'multiverseId': 227474}, 'multiverseid': 227474}]", "[{'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227475&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9521eae6-91fc-4255-86cc-927480e8c38f', 'multiverseId': 227475}, 'multiverseid': 227475}]", "[{'name': '巣立つ大口獣', 'text': '飛行\\n{T}：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。巣立つ大口獣はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\n変異 {U}{U} （あなたはこれを、{3}を支払うことで、裏向きの２/２のクリーチャーとして唱えてもよい。 いつでも変異コストを支払ってそれを表向きにすることができる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227464&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c779cd6a-273e-492f-b397-87bac2b96999', 'multiverseId': 227464}, 'multiverseid': 227464}]", "[{'name': '悪魔火', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。悪魔火はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。 このターン、これによりダメージを与えられたクリーチャーがいずれかの墓地に置かれる場合、代わりにそれを追放する。\\n暴勇 ― あなたの手札にカードが無い場合、悪魔火は呪文や能力によって打ち消されず、そのダメージは軽減されない。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227451&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a667f8c1-dbe9-4e14-8f6e-622bea8b282d', 'multiverseId': 227451}, 'multiverseid': 227451}]", "[{'name': '意志を曲げる者', 'text': '変異 {1}{U} （あなたはこれを、{3}を支払うことで、裏向きの２/２のクリーチャーとして唱えてもよい。 いつでも変異コストを支払ってそれを表向きにすることができる。）\\n意志を曲げる者が表向きになったとき、単一の対象を持つ呪文１つか能力１つを対象とし、それの対象を変更する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227502&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a8c6076-6d65-491c-859b-85435e00d1ea', 'multiverseId': 227502}, 'multiverseid': 227502}]", "[{'name': '投火師', 'text': '{T}：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。投火師はそれに１点のダメージを与え、あなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「投火師の寓話の教訓を忘れなさるな。権力を手に入れれば、孤独も一緒についてくるというあの教訓を。」\\n――銀のゴーレム、カーン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227459&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bca9baeb-c586-4be7-85ce-e4125450c9c4', 'multiverseId': 227459}, 'multiverseid': 227459}]", "[{'name': '排撃', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「お前らはお呼びじゃないんだ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227492&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4b8eab2-3ac1-4757-9d23-97af38caff73', 'multiverseId': 227492}, 'multiverseid': 227492}]", "[{'name': '敵愾', 'text': '速攻\\nあなたがコントロールする呪文がいずれかの対戦相手にダメージを与える場合、そのダメージをすべて軽減し、０にする。 これにより軽減されたダメージ１点につき、速攻を持つ赤の３/１のエレメンタル・シャーマン・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\\n敵愾がいずれかの領域からいずれかの墓地に置かれたとき、それをオーナーのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・インカーネーション', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227468&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '606ac53a-1e6f-4b07-929a-ce6360d702e2', 'multiverseId': 227468}, 'multiverseid': 227468}]", "[{'name': '水深の予見者', 'text': '変異 ― あなたがコントロールする島を２枚オーナーの手札に戻す。 （あなたはこれを、{3}を支払うことで、裏向きの２/２のクリーチャーとして唱えてもよい。 いつでも変異コストを支払ってそれを表向きにすることができる。）\\n水深の予見者が表向きになったとき、カードを２枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — イリュージョン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227455&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e936568b-a658-44a4-9570-8be453abec7f', 'multiverseId': 227455}, 'multiverseid': 227455}]", "[{'name': '水銀のドラゴン', 'text': '飛行\\n{U}：呪文１つを対象とする。それの対象が１つだけでその対象が水銀のドラゴンである場合、その呪文の対象を他のクリーチャーに変える。\\n変異 {4}{U} （あなたはこれを、{3}を支払うことで、裏向きの２/２のクリーチャーとして唱えてもよい。 いつでも変異コストを支払ってそれを表向きにすることができる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227490&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dc846b7b-c1b8-499e-9eaf-59fc95a3edc0', 'multiverseId': 227490}, 'multiverseid': 227490}]", "[{'name': '火の玉', 'text': '望む数のクリーチャーかプレイヤー（またはその組み合わせ）を対象とする。火の玉はそれらに、Ｘ点を均等に割った点数のダメージを与える（端数切捨て）。\\n火の玉を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{1}多くなる。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'その呪文は、古えの死に満ちたドラゴンのように群集に降り注いだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227456&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '72e6526e-8440-40a4-8037-cb3f7c54934a', 'multiverseId': 227456}, 'multiverseid': 227456}]", "[{'name': '火の突撃者', 'text': '速攻\\n{R}：火の突撃者はターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・戦士', 'flavor': '彼の刃は、うめく樹人の炭で鍛えられ、いくつもの頭を切り落とす理想的な角度に曲げられ、自身が触れることで火山の熱を帯びる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227489&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b057a8b4-a265-43fb-8694-472322a66601', 'multiverseId': 227489}, 'multiverseid': 227489}]", "[{'name': '火炎放射', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人と、他のクリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人と、３番目のクリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。火炎放射はその１番目に１点のダメージを与え、その２番目に２点のダメージを与え、その３番目に３点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227448&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '717183e3-33e8-4deb-9f64-4185d4246efb', 'multiverseId': 227448}, 'multiverseid': 227448}]", "[{'name': '火炎破', 'text': 'あなたは火炎破のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、山を２つ生け贄に捧げてもよい。\\nクリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。火炎破はそれに４点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '燃えさし魔道士たちは、交渉の手腕で名高いわけではない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227457&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b042f87f-ad18-44cd-a59a-6312e4f5e20a', 'multiverseId': 227457}, 'multiverseid': 227457}]", "[{'name': '火炎舌のカヴー', 'text': '火炎舌のカヴーが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。火炎舌のカヴーはそれに４点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — カヴー', 'flavor': '「鈍くて愚かな遺伝子変異体の割には、狙いを定めるのが結構うまいわね。」\\n――ウェザーライトの艦長、シッセイ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227462&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ec2b617-4278-4d1f-a02c-cfaf397bdb3f', 'multiverseId': 227462}, 'multiverseid': 227462}]", "[{'name': '火葬', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。火葬はそれに３点のダメージを与える。 このターン、これによりダメージを与えられたクリーチャーは再生できない。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「人生に確かなものは無いなんて誰が言ったの？ こいつが痛いのは確かよ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227469&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '061a5de0-abc0-411f-9c88-53f296131457', 'multiverseId': 227469}, 'multiverseid': 227469}]", "[{'name': '炎の印章', 'text': '炎の印章を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。炎の印章はそれに２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '炎の包まれたままの場所を去ることが四度目に達した後、チャンドラはただ先へと進み、それを自分のものにしようと決心した。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227494&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58459d4f-f822-46c3-a95e-595d989c493f', 'multiverseId': 227494}, 'multiverseid': 227494}]", "[{'name': '炎の投げ槍', 'text': '（{2/R}は、任意の２マナか{R}で支払うことができる。 このカードの点数で見たマナ・コストは６である。）\\nクリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。炎の投げ槍はそれに４点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '彼女にその恐るべき正確さが無かったなら、槍放りのギャラは恐るべき正確さで名をはせただろう。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227460&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '572b991d-189e-4f1a-811c-2dba93651e77', 'multiverseId': 227460}, 'multiverseid': 227460}]", "[{'name': '炎の稲妻', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。炎の稲妻はそれに２点のダメージを与える。\\nフラッシュバック {4}{R} （あなたはフラッシュバック・コストで、このカードをあなたの墓地から唱えてもよい。その後、それを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'さあ行って誰かに火をつけろ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227458&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '807484cd-19d8-42ed-8620-7414b3aafc63', 'multiverseId': 227458}, 'multiverseid': 227458}]", "[{'name': '炎族の喧嘩屋', 'text': '{R}：炎族の喧嘩屋はターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・戦士', 'flavor': '一度殴れば、殴り続ける。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227461&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20d0d7f5-1e2f-4411-8d3b-dfe061b0cfe0', 'multiverseId': 227461}, 'multiverseid': 227461}]", "[{'name': '炎歩スリス', 'text': '速攻\\n炎歩スリスがいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スリス', 'flavor': 'そのスリスは大焼炉の熱で孵り、ミラディンに四つの太陽が昇るときだけ姿を現す。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227495&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb7c6cc7-f966-43a8-b107-fb1601577700', 'multiverseId': 227495}, 'multiverseid': 227495}]", "[{'name': '炎波の発動者', 'text': '{7}{R}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。炎波の発動者はそのプレイヤーに５点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ミュータント', 'flavor': '最も謙虚なゴブリンの中にさえ、遥かな力が秘められている――遥かにひどい物でもあるが。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227463&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7736b40-738f-421e-8e15-59070763aa0c', 'multiverseId': 227463}, 'multiverseid': 227463}]", "[{'name': '焼炉の仔', 'text': '飛行\\n{R}：焼炉の仔はターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': 'ドラゴンの子供には、人間とは何なのか理解できない――殺されるのがいやなら、なんで彼らは肉と宝物でできてるんだろう？', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227465&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '285bf3e2-64da-4c5e-8b2d-fc4950d2d25e', 'multiverseId': 227465}, 'multiverseid': 227465}]", "[{'name': '熟考漂い', 'text': '飛行\\n熟考漂いが戦場に出たとき、カードを２枚引く。\\n想起 {2}{U} （あなたはこの呪文を、その想起コストを支払って唱えてもよい。そうした場合、戦場に出たときにそれを生け贄に捧げる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227486&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e96d0967-b1d8-484f-ab8b-631911086104', 'multiverseId': 227486}, 'multiverseid': 227486}]", "[{'name': '狡知', 'text': '狡知は３体以上のクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。\\nあなたがコントロールする呪文や能力がいずれかの呪文を打ち消す場合、代わりにその呪文を追放する。あなたはそのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。\\n狡知がいずれかの領域からいずれかの墓地に置かれたとき、それをオーナーのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・インカーネーション', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227466&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6945021-724d-477a-bc9b-eecda34d6162', 'multiverseId': 227466}, 'multiverseid': 227466}]", "[{'name': '目くらまし', 'text': 'あなたは目くらましのマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、あなたがコントロールする島を１つオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。\\n呪文１つを対象とする。そのコントローラーが{1}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227450&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b635fbcb-4062-4791-98f7-422fd9763225', 'multiverseId': 227450}, 'multiverseid': 227450}]", "[{'name': '知恵の蛇', 'text': '知恵の蛇が攻撃してブロックされないたび、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。そうした場合、このターン、知恵の蛇は戦闘ダメージを与えない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 蛇', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227487&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d5f80c4-ffd1-4789-9451-a7145324b72c', 'multiverseId': 227487}, 'multiverseid': 227487}]", "[{'name': '祖先の幻視', 'text': '祖先の幻視は青である。\\n待機４―{U} （これをあなたの手札から唱えるのではなく、{U}を支払って時間カウンターを4個置いた状態で追放する。 あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。 最後の１個を取り除いたとき、あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払わずに唱える。\\nプレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを３枚引く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227442&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '39f1ce43-0984-4b50-b3e9-a9b4b75c2c44', 'multiverseId': 227442}, 'multiverseid': 227442}]", "[{'name': '竜巻のジン', 'text': '飛行\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたがコントロールするアンタップ状態の島を１つオーナーの手札に戻さないかぎり、竜巻のジンを生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ジン', 'flavor': '「高度を上げて！ あいつの嵐から抜け出すのよ。」\\n――ウェザーライトの艦長、シッセイ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227501&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1cf19c6-75d5-4538-85a9-45b0b61efdc9', 'multiverseId': 227501}, 'multiverseid': 227501}]", "[{'name': '精神石', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, 精神石を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '「マナはまだ形を成していない発想よ。それが可能性でなければ何だというの？」\\n――工芸の達人、ジョイラ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227481&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20b30f19-0783-4680-9992-7a7d4c6fee33', 'multiverseId': 227481}, 'multiverseid': 227481}]", "[{'name': '虚空魔道士の弟子', 'text': '変異 {2}{U}{U} （あなたはこれを、{3}を支払うことで、裏向きの２/２のクリーチャーとして唱えてもよい。 いつでも変異コストを支払ってそれを表向きにすることができる。）\\n虚空魔道士の弟子が表向きになったとき、呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227499&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a22017b-4e1f-4c09-a5a2-7dd5a13b377a', 'multiverseId': 227499}, 'multiverseid': 227499}]", "[{'name': '裂け目翼の雲間を泳ぐもの', 'text': '飛行\\n裂け目翼の雲間を泳ぐものが戦場に出たとき、パーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n待機３―{1}{U} （これをあなたの手札から唱えるのではなく、{1}{U}を支払って時間カウンターを３個置いた状態で追放してよい。 あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。 最後の１個を取り除いたとき、あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払わずに唱える。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — イリュージョン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227493&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1e5cbf6-b1fc-4db7-a507-c2a98654b9f6', 'multiverseId': 227493}, 'multiverseid': 227493}]", "[{'name': '詐欺の壁', 'text': '防衛\\n{3}：詐欺の壁を裏向きにする。\\n変異 {U} （あなたはこれを、{3}を支払うことで、裏向きの２/２のクリーチャーとして唱えてもよい。 いつでも変異コストを支払ってそれを表向きにすることができる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 壁', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227500&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3aae28d-cf10-4f54-b6cd-a7170bb3748c', 'multiverseId': 227500}, 'multiverseid': 227500}]", "[{'name': '遍歴のカゲロウ獣', 'text': '飛行\\n待機４―{1}{U} （これをあなたの手札から唱えるのではなく、{1}{U}を支払って時間カウンターを4個置いた状態で追放してよい。 あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。 最後の１個を取り除いたとき、あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払わずに唱える。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — イリュージョン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227453&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c046638-9ade-419b-a521-2a3e6ce6cef4', 'multiverseId': 227453}, 'multiverseid': 227453}]", "[{'name': '鋳塊かじり', 'text': '鋳塊かじりが戦場に出たとき、アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n想起 {R} （あなたはこの呪文を、その想起コストを支払って唱えてもよい。そうした場合、戦場に出たときにそれを生け贄に捧げる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': '精霊は形を成した思考だ。 例えばこいつは「ぶち壊しがい」という考えだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227470&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '47674785-a655-4798-994b-907841c24cc6', 'multiverseId': 227470}, 'multiverseid': 227470}]", "[{'name': '霊気撃ち', 'text': '霊気撃ちが戦場に出たとき、土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n想起 {1}{U}{U} （あなたはこの呪文を、その想起コストを支払って唱えてもよい。そうした場合、戦場に出たときにそれを生け贄に捧げる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227440&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf74688b-5c7e-44d7-b760-35fcad4ae465', 'multiverseId': 227440}, 'multiverseid': 227440}]", "[{'name': '霜の殉教者', 'text': '{2}, あなたの手札から青のカードをＸ枚公開する, 霜の殉教者を生け贄に捧げる：呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{X}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「バルデュヴィア人を蛮族と呼んではならぬ。 彼らの魔術は、原始的であるからこそ力を持つのだ。」\\n――結界師ズアー', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227480&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fbf5e5ee-448b-4d03-9879-21b3f55e5477', 'multiverseId': 227480}, 'multiverseid': 227480}]", "[{'name': '魂光りの炎族', 'text': '{2}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時までトランプルを得る。 これが、この能力がこのターンに解決された３回目である場合、あなたはあなたのマナ・プールに{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}を加えてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・シャーマン', 'flavor': '挑発された炎族の内なる炎は、どんな巨人の炉よりもはるかに熱い。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227496&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cccca070-9c5e-4505-b506-335843e1860b', 'multiverseId': 227496}, 'multiverseid': 227496}]", "[{'name': '黒焦げ牙のクーガー', 'text': '{R}：黒焦げ牙のクーガーはターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n山サイクリング {2} （{2}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから山カード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加える。 その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猫・ビースト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=227446&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff64349c-7bc2-4f45-94ca-7d048327eaa9', 'multiverseId': 227446}, 'multiverseid': 227446}]"]
